  "extraction_changes": [
    "One binary selects variants through a shared runtime launch registry.",
    "Original FP32 cell body and temporal collision expressions are preserved.",
    "Grid utilities exclude unused legacy CUDA allocation/transfer helpers; no Parboil/OpenCL dependency.",
    "Temporal tile extents become compile-time template parameters. Debug-only counters and assertions are omitted.",
    "T30 V2 uses the generic V2 core guard instead of the original core_active helper; resource allocation changes from 56 to 63 registers/thread with this compiler. All performance rows were remeasured.",
